eight=\"10\" style=\"height:10px;font-size:0;border-bottom:10px solid #f5f5f5\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>      <tr>\r\n<td height=\"10\" style=\"height:10px;font-size:0\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr><tr>\r\n<td style=\"padding:20px 3.5% 10px;line-height:1.5\">\r\n<span class=\"b k\" style=\"font-size:27px;font-family:'gorditamedium',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#222;letter-spacing:-0.1px;line-height:1.5\">  1 big thing: Dolly Parton&#x27;s legacy sparks a giving wave </span>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>   <tr>\r\n<td height=\"10\" style=\"height:10px;font-size:0\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr> <tr>\r\n<td class=\"v\" style=\"padding:0 3.5%;line-height:1.75;font-size:17px;font-family:Georgia,serif;color:#222;letter-spacing:-0.1px\"><div align=\"center\"><!--[if mso]><img alt='' src='https://images.axios.com/mjyZs7jm_a9PzF99RcKeBAdi1Pk=/fit-in/1116x1300/2026/09/23/1790198941317.jpeg' style='display:block; margin: 0 auto; max-width:100%;' width='558' /><![endif]--><!--[if !mso]><!--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://images.axios.com/mjyZs7jm_a9PzF99RcKeBAdi1Pk=/fit-in/1116x1300/2026/09/23/1790198941317.jpeg\" style=\"display:block; margin: 0 auto; max-width:100%;\" width=\"100%\"/><!--<![endif]--></div> <div class=\"bodytext\" style=\"font-size:13px; font-family:'Gordita',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color:#848484; margin-bottom:20px;\">A portrait of Dolly Parton fills a 5-acre corn maze at Twins BBQ Co. in Brookfield, Conn., on Sept. 13. Photo: Ted Shaffrey/AP</div><p><strong>Dolly Parton spent </strong>her life giving back to children and their communities. Since her death, her fans have been carrying on that legacy.</p><ul><li><strong>It's the Dolly effect:</strong> In cities across America, people are donating their time and money, expanding Dolly's Imagination Library — her book-gifting program for kids — and starting projects of their own.</li></ul><p><strong>📚 The big picture:</strong> Dolly started the <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47622424.248580/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnaW5hdGlvbmxpYnJhcnkuY29tLz91dG1fc291cmNlPW5ld3NsZXR0ZXImdXRtX21lZGl1bT1lbWFpbCZ1dG1fY2FtcGFpZ249bmV3c2xldHRlcl9heGlvc2ZpbmlzaGxpbmUmc3RyZWFtPXRvcA/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aBa215c9ba\" target=\"_blank\">Imagination Library</a> in 1995 to honor her father, who couldn't read or write. The program sends over 3 million free books to children across five countries each month — and organizations and individuals are building on that legacy to reach even more.</p><ul><li><strong>In </strong><a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47622424.248580/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cud2ZseC5jb20vMjAyNi8wOS8xNi9kb2xseS1wYXJ0b25zLWltYWdpbmF0aW9uLWxpYnJhcnktc2Vlcy1zdXJnZS1kb25hdGlvbnMtcmVnaXN0cmF0aW9ucy1hZnRlci1oZXItZGVhdGg_dXRtX3NvdXJjZT1uZXdzbGV0dGVyJnV0bV9tZWRpdW09ZW1haWwmdXRtX2NhbXBhaWduPW5ld3NsZXR0ZXJfYXhpb3NmaW5pc2hsaW5lJnN0cmVhbT10b3A/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aBbfd4fa5d\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Florida</strong></a><strong>, </strong><a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47622424.248580/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cud3JpYy5jb20vbmV3cy9sb2NhbC1uZXdzL3JpY2htb25kL2ltYWdpbmF0aW9uLWxpYnJhcnktYXR0ZW50aW9uLWRvbGx5LXBhcnRvbi1kZWF0aC8_dXRtX3NvdXJjZT1uZXdzbGV0dGVyJnV0bV9tZWRpdW09ZW1haWwmdXRtX2NhbXBhaWduPW5ld3NsZXR0ZXJfYXhpb3NmaW5pc2hsaW5lJnN0cmVhbT10b3A/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aB4817e7bb\" target=\"_blank\">Virginia</a>, <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47622424.\" target=\"_blank\">Ohio</a> and elsewhere, Imagination Library affiliates have seen a surge in both donations and registrations since the star's passing on Aug. 25.</li><li><strong>In Houston, </strong>public libraries are <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47622424.248580/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuYXhpb3MuY29tL2xvY2FsL2hvdXN0b24vMjAyNi8wOS8xNy9kb2xseS1wYXJ0b24taW1hZ2luYXRpb24tbGlicmFyeS1wcm9ncmFtLWV4cGFuZHM_dXRtX3NvdXJjZT1uZXdzbGV0dGVyJnV0bV9tZWRpdW09ZW1haWwmdXRtX2NhbXBhaWduPW5ld3NsZXR0ZXJfYXhpb3NmaW5pc2hsaW5lJnN0cmVhbT10b3A/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aB7ac55130\" target=\"_blank\">working with</a> the Imagination Library of Greater Houston to help more families sign up their children.</li><li><strong>In West Virginia,</strong> literacy nonprofit Read Aloud West Virginia is <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47622424.248580/aHR0cHM6Ly93b2F5LmNvbS9yZWFkLWFsb3VkLXdlc3QtdmlyZ2luaWEtdG8tbGF1bmNoLWZ1bmRyYWlzaW5nLWNhbXBhaWduLW1hdGNoaW5nLWltYWdpbmF0aW9uLWxpYnJhcnktZG9uYXRpb25zLWluLW1lbW9yeS1vZi1kb2xseS1wYXJ0b24_dXRtX3NvdXJjZT1uZXdzbGV0dGVyJnV0bV9tZWRpdW09ZW1haWwmdXRtX2NhbXBhaWduPW5ld3NsZXR0ZXJfYXhpb3NmaW5pc2hsaW5lJnN0cmVhbT10b3A/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aB7484a727\" target=\"_blank\">matching this month's donations</a> to local Imagination Library affiliates when donors write \"in memory of Dolly\" with their contributions.</li><li><strong>In London, </strong>Dolly's Imagination Library is <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47622424.248580/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuYmJjLmNvbS9uZXdzL2FydGljbGVzL2Nrd3l6MDZxZzk4M28_dXRtX3NvdXJjZT1uZXdzbGV0dGVyJnV0bV9tZWRpdW09ZW1haWwmdXRtX2NhbXBhaWduPW5ld3NsZXR0ZXJfYXhpb3NmaW5pc2hsaW5lJnN0cmVhbT10b3A/6a14a774a4e0095e0a03c94aB125bb893\" target=\"_blank\">doubling</a> the number of boroughs it covers.</li></ul><p><strong>🎸 What's next: </strong>This Friday — 9/25, a nod to Dolly's \"9 to 5\" movie — will be the first annual Give Like Dolly Day, created by The Dollywood Foundation to encourage people around the world to support children's literacy.</p><ul><li><strong>One Nashville honky-tonk </strong>is <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47622424.\" target=\"_blank\">giving 100% of Friday's sales</a> to the Imagination Library and Nashville Public Libraries.</li></ul></td>\r\n</tr> <tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px 3.5% 25px\">   <a href=\"https://link.axios.com/click/47622424.248580/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuZmFjZWJvb2suY29tL3NoYXJlci5waHA_dT1odHRwczovL3d3dy5heGlvcy5jb20vbmV3c2xldHRlcnMvYXhpb3MtZmluaXNoLWxpbmUtZDE4MzM0NTEtZmVkNS00NDc1LThjZTgtZjkxZjg0ODg2YmRhLmh0bWw_Y2h1bmslM0QxJTI2dXRtX3Rlcm0lM0RmYnNvY2lhbHNoYXJlJTIzc3RvcnkxJnV0bV9zb3VyY2U9bmV3c2xldHRlciZ1dG1fbWVkaXVtPWVtYWlsJnV0bV9jYW1wYWlnbj1uZXdzbGV0dGVyX2F4aW9zZmluaXNob